# ============================================================
# Data
# ============================================================
# The raw CSV is public and downloadable via data_loader.py.
# It is also committed here so the deployed Streamlit app does
# not need a network call at startup.
# Remove the lines below if you prefer fresh downloads instead.
# data/raw/*
# !data/raw/.gitkeep

# Processed splits are reproducible from run_stage1.py but are
# committed for convenience (they are only ~860 KB total).
# data/processed/*
# !data/processed/.gitkeep

# ============================================================
# Artifacts -- COMMITTED to GitHub
# ============================================================
# The Streamlit app is a read-only interface over these files.
# They must be present in the repository for Streamlit Community
# Cloud to serve the application correctly.
# random_forest.pkl is 5 MB -- well within GitHub's 100 MB limit.

# ============================================================
# Report figures -- COMMITTED to GitHub
# ============================================================
# All PNGs in reports/figures/ are pre-generated by Stage 4 and
# Stage 5 and displayed by the Streamlit app. They must be present.

# ============================================================
# Python
# ============================================================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ============================================================
# Editors / OS
# ============================================================
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.DS_Store

# ============================================================
# AI assistant local config -- NOT for public repositories
# ============================================================
.claude/
